Notion-style avatar artwork
===========================

The avatar layers in parts.generated.ts are derived from the "Notion-style
avatar" illustration pack by Felix Wong, released under CC0 1.0 (public
domain dedication).

    https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

They were vendored from the notion-avatar project by Mayandev, which is
licensed under the MIT License:

    https://github.com/Mayandev/notion-avatar

Only the `public/avatar/preview` layers are vendored, and the seasonal
`festival` pack is excluded. Regenerate with:

    node scripts/vendor-notion-avatar.mjs /path/to/notion-avatar
